                        ],
                        "form": "обуче́ниях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fd724458-554e-3d33-ad92-8b34e2d5055e",
                        "entry_id": "c4c45f23-fe09-30c5-a2cb-b8ebaed844d3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. обучить, обучиться, обучать, обучаться"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e0e7f1a3-97f0-40c0-8ad1-763b2231ded3",
                                "sense_id": "fd724458-554e-3d33-ad92-8b34e2d5055e",
                                "text": "Опыт работы многих специалистов показывает, что начальное обучение плаванию с использованием ласт значительно ускоряет этот процесс и позволяет предупредить и исправить многие ошибки в движениях ногами."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7059ba11-6572-47e0-a55d-ac7c6f035870",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4c45f23-fe09-30c5-a2cb-b8ebaed844d3",
                        "source_sense_id": "fd724458-554e-3d33-ad92-8b34e2d5055e",
                        "target_lang_word": "education",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "education",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d3dc396-ac43-3bf0-a2bb-4da1a67c358d",
                                        "entry_id": "ed9a0c94-3e71-380e-a981-5a0b4e0852a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The process of imparting knowledge, skill and judgment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70b3850f-a750-4e57-a7ac-8ccd06addcce",
                                                "sense_id": "8d3dc396-ac43-3bf0-a2bb-4da1a67c358d",
                                                "text": "For though education, in the true sense of the word, is necessary to excellence, yet a question still lies open, What is education? Is it certain old rules of thinking which require to be forced on the individual by others, more particularly than those which, by the exercise of his own faculties, he perceives in nature and life within and around him, and seizes, concentrates, abstracts, and digests for himself? Some do this spontaneously with unaccountable facility, such as Shakespeare, Burns, and Ebenezer Elliot; while others never can be tutored into any method of it by old rules, and often, when even stuffed in \"the schools\" to repletion, feel only besotted from a mind full of old abstruse indigestibles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93b14513-baaa-47ee-8a56-9f4f413de30c",
                                                "sense_id": "8d3dc396-ac43-3bf0-a2bb-4da1a67c358d",
                                                "text": "One particularly damaging, but often ignored, effect of conflict on education is the proliferation of attacks on schools[…]as children, teachers or school buildings become the targets of attacks. Parents fear sending their children to school. Girls are particularly vulnerable to sexual violence."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d81c7352-2bbb-4f90-aa21-12e57b1e1efc",
                                                "sense_id": "8d3dc396-ac43-3bf0-a2bb-4da1a67c358d",
                                                "text": "Good education is essential for a well-run society."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f89c8fd8-c11a-3862-99a9-2dd97953ed14",
                                        "entry_id": "ed9a0c94-3e71-380e-a981-5a0b4e0852a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Facts, skills and ideas that have been learned, especially through formal instruction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b9c2325b-9114-4df5-842d-b4ebe9ec8beb",
                                                "sense_id": "f89c8fd8-c11a-3862-99a9-2dd97953ed14",
                                                "text": "Nuh-nuh-doin'-duh... Nuh-nuh-doin'-duh... We don't need no education...\nYes, you do. You've just used a double negative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "985ffaca-f4f6-485f-aeac-de0b69c62cac",
                                                "sense_id": "f89c8fd8-c11a-3862-99a9-2dd97953ed14",
                                                "text": "It is time the international community faced the reality: we have an unmanageable, unfair, distortionary global tax regime. […] It is the starving of the public sector which has been pivotal in America no longer being the land of opportunity – with a child's life prospects more dependent on the income and education of its parents than in other advanced countries."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "479cd529-4c42-4ad6-a5e5-c54047454be6",
                                                "sense_id": "f89c8fd8-c11a-3862-99a9-2dd97953ed14",
                                                "text": "He has had a classical education."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e9dcd255-06df-4d9d-9362-148a64670cf0",
                                                "sense_id": "f89c8fd8-c11a-3862-99a9-2dd97953ed14",
                                                "text": "The educations our children receive depend on their economic status."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1e52cf67-4651-3153-9812-2ed9588b9340",
                                        "entry_id": "ed9a0c94-3e71-380e-a981-5a0b4e0852a0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Upbringing, rearing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9147fc67-d681-4f5e-926d-92b0097827fa",
                                                "sense_id": "1e52cf67-4651-3153-9812-2ed9588b9340",
                                                "text": "I found them [my children] all I could wish and progressing rapidly under the truly maternal care of the kind Sisters who cared for their education."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e0b9f04d-04b4-4daa-9d24-34fccd85ceb2",
                        "source_entry_id": "c4c45f23-fe09-30c5-a2cb-b8ebaed844d3",
                        "source_sense_id": "fd724458-554e-3d33-ad92-8b34e2d5055e",
                        "target_lang_word": "instruction",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "instruction",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bda2d9e-053d-3fec-8749-9c619ca9c091",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of instructing, teaching, or providing with information or knowledge."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f19e2308-8eff-4686-82ae-ec07d6e3a113",
                                                "sense_id": "2bda2d9e-053d-3fec-8749-9c619ca9c091",
                                                "text": "Students receive instruction in the arts and sciences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c86c01d8-86af-4695-aea1-0e25a643c1cf",
                                                "sense_id": "2bda2d9e-053d-3fec-8749-9c619ca9c091",
                                                "text": "Instruction will be provided on how to handle difficult customers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b62af6c-5c82-44e4-b33b-3a50735d5110",
                                                "sense_id": "2bda2d9e-053d-3fec-8749-9c619ca9c091",
                                                "text": "Anstruther laughed good-naturedly. “[…] I shall take out half a dozen intelligent maistries from our Press and get them to give our villagers instruction when they begin work and when they are in the fields.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0633c6d0-59b2-32b8-8769-83fd26ceb30a",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of the information or knowledge so furnished."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1ca4972-f762-433d-99af-4a2e5f3697a1",
                                                "sense_id": "0633c6d0-59b2-32b8-8769-83fd26ceb30a",
                                                "text": "If my instructions may be your guide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ad274ad-95b5-3e25-a9cf-5f82c1393b02",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An order or command."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0bd04fb-e5ab-4d58-961e-1122a1ce7c05",
                                                "sense_id": "8ad274ad-95b5-3e25-a9cf-5f82c1393b02",
                                                "text": "Thus, when he drew up instructions in lawyer language, he expressed the important words by an initial, a medial, or a final consonant, and made scratches for all the words between; his clerks, however, understood him very well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b9cc7fbb-1cd6-3a11-9689-2a40f318e7a8",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A set of directions provided by a manufacturer for the users of a product or service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02a4c346-afd9-3cfe-ac49-24dc0e8cebe8",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The directions given by a client to their lawyer in relation to a particular legal matter, which govern the purpose and scope of their work."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "in-plural",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7a4ed2b3-0b52-4c2e-a8ad-9b949dc64c7a",
                                                "sense_id": "02a4c346-afd9-3cfe-ac49-24dc0e8cebe8",
                                                "text": "I cannot act until I have taken instructions from my client."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61647c10-289e-3055-92db-f2d1462f018b",
                                        "entry_id": "14a601fa-9275-300e-90b4-ca3a762260d9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A single operation of a processor defined by an instruction set architecture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
